This is used in combination with OWL punning to characterise the type of an instance of datacite:QualifiedRelation via the property datacite:hasRelationCharacterization.        
        """@en ;
        rdfs:subPropertyOf dc:relation , 
                dcterms:relation ;
        vs:term_status "stable"@en .


